[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0010","text":"今天的工作……\n好累……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0020","text":"……甜花，已经……\n体力归零……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0030","text":"等等等等，在这里睡可不行\n我送你回住处，再坚持一下好吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0040","text":"…………回去的路上……\n听说有游戏厅……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0043","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0050","text":"以前的游戏……\n可能有很多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0060","text":"工作人员说的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0070","text":"好，那就去那家游戏厅\n看看吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0080","text":"制作人也……\n一起玩……吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0090","text":"嗯，好啊\n能不能当你的对手就不知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_01_0100","text":"太好了……！\n嘿嘿……快，走吧……！"}]
